# Written by the session at the merge: jump targets inside UNIT_CHECK_DISK no range labelled
rom ep-exdos13.rom page 0 cpu z80
default observed

@0C45 UNIT_ASK_DISK
  Loop: asks for the drive's disk (error $B3) until the check at $0C7F finds it in.

@0C54 UNIT_CHK_POP_IX
  The right disk is in: restores IX, then falls into the common exit.

@0C56 UNIT_CHK_POP_BC
  Restores BC, then falls into the common exit.

@0C57 UNIT_CHK_DONE
  The common exit: restores DE and AF.

feedback missing 0C45-0C57 Four jump targets inside one routine were left unlabelled between ranges; the problem list caught them only at the merge
